        <mxCell id="BA-kJKM7H-5up3utx_z7-99" value="&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Communication&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Container On Machine 1 can talk to each other privately&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;But Can&#39;t talk to conatiner on Other Machine Privately&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Orchestrator:&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;orchestrator creates a private cluster network between all the nodes joins the cluster&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;container gets the IP from the private network&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;orchestrator have inbuild controllers that provide HA and FT for containers&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;HA -&amp;gt; Multiple Instance of same app controlled by Load Balancer&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;FT -&amp;gt; In case of failure Node crashed , pod created automatically in another node&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
