        <mxCell id="MqqCgQeVMcNDNWYN53Kr-13" value="&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;Storage CSI should be running as a Pod&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;The Job of this CSI is to connect to the Storage System.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;reguest for 5 GB of volume created in K8s&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;equest forwarded to the csi&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;csi is as a bridge between k8s cluster and storage system&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;csi forwarded to the storage system&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;storage system create a volume&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;volume reference created in K8s cluster&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
